#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use Qiskit Serverless to run quantum-classical workloads across the cloud and on quantum-centric supercomputers."
msgstr "Gamitin ang Qiskit Serverless para patakbuhin ang mga quantum-classical na workload sa buong cloud at sa mga quantum-centric supercomputer."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Serverless"
msgstr "Panimula sa Qiskit Serverless"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Introduction to Qiskit Serverless {#introduction-to-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Panimula sa Qiskit Serverless {#introduction-to-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Serverless provides a simple interface to run workloads across quantum-classical resources. This includes deploying programs to the IBM Quantum&reg; Platform and running workloads remotely, as well as easy resource management for multi-cloud and quantum-centric supercomputing use cases.\n"
msgstr "Ang Qiskit Serverless ay nagbibigay ng simpleng interface para patakbuhin ang mga workload sa quantum-classical na mga resources. Kasama dito ang pag-deploy ng mga programa sa IBM Quantum&reg; Platform at ang pagpapatakbo ng mga workload nang remote, gayundin ang madaling pamamahala ng resources para sa mga use case ng multi-cloud at quantum-centric supercomputing.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Premium users can build, deploy, and run their workloads remotely on classical compute made available through IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga premium na gumagamit ay maaaring mag-build, mag-deploy, at magpatakbo ng kanilang mga workload nang remote sa classical compute na ibinibigay sa pamamagitan ng IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Qiskit Serverless is getting an upgrade, and its features are changing fast.** During this development phase, find release notes and the most recent documentation at the [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html) page.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"**Ang Qiskit Serverless ay nagpa-upgrade, at mabilis na nagbabago ang mga feature nito.** Sa panahon ng development phase na ito, hanapin ang mga release note at pinakabagong dokumentasyon sa pahina ng [Qiskit Serverless GitHub](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/index.html).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This is an experimental feature available only for IBM Quantum Premium Plan, Flex Plan, and On-Prem (via IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan users.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Ito ay isang experimental na feature na available lamang para sa mga gumagamit ng IBM Quantum Premium Plan, Flex Plan, at On-Prem (sa pamamagitan ng IBM Quantum Platform API) Plan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "When should I use Qiskit Serverless? {#when-should-i-use-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "Kailan dapat gamitin ang Qiskit Serverless? {#when-should-i-use-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Serverless helps manage classical and quantum resources across the entire [Qiskit patterns](/guides/intro-to-patterns) workflow. This includes some of the following examples:\n"
msgstr "Tinutulungan ng Qiskit Serverless ang pamamahala ng classical at quantum na mga resources sa buong [Qiskit patterns](/guides/intro-to-patterns) na workflow. Kasama dito ang ilan sa mga sumusunod na halimbawa:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parallelizing classical tasks, such as pre-processing and post-processing\n"
msgstr "Pag-parallelize ng mga classical na gawain, tulad ng pre-processing at post-processing\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Persisting long-running workloads in the cloud, even if your laptop is turned off\n"
msgstr "Pagpapanatili ng mga matagal na workload sa cloud, kahit nakapatay na ang iyong laptop\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploying reusable programs\n"
msgstr "Pag-deploy ng mga reusable na programa\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "What is included? {#what-is-included}"
msgstr "Ano ang kasama? {#what-is-included}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following compute resources are included by default in the Qiskit Serverless environment. Users can contact [support](/guides/support) to increase any of these.\n"
msgstr "Ang mga sumusunod na compute resources ay kasama bilang default sa kapaligiran ng Qiskit Serverless. Maaaring makipag-ugnayan ang mga gumagamit sa [support](/guides/support) para palakihin ang alinman sa mga ito.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid "Maximum of two active jobs per user at any one time\n"
msgid ""
"**Normal node:** \n"
"- 24 vCPU cores\n"
"- 120GB RAM\n"
"- Maximum of two active jobs per user at any one time\n"
msgstr "Maximum na dalawang aktibong job bawat gumagamit sa anumang oras\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**GPU node** (used by the [Algorithmiq TEM](/guides/algorithmiq-tem) Qiskit Function):\n"
"- 24 vCPU cores\n"
"- 120GB RAM\n"
"- Nvidia L40S GPU\n"
"- Maximum of four active jobs per user at any one time\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Serverless {#install-qiskit-serverless}"
msgstr "I-install ang Qiskit Serverless {#install-qiskit-serverless}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To use Qiskit Serverless on IBM Quantum Platform, install the following packages:\n"
msgstr "Para gamitin ang Qiskit Serverless sa IBM Quantum Platform, i-install ang mga sumusunod na package:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit_ibm_catalog` provides the client-side tools to upload and run remote programs, while `qiskit_serverless` provides server-side tools to distribute compute and manage data. These packages require `python` 3.11+. For users and organizations who want to run Qiskit Serverless on custom infrastructure, follow the [Cloud infrastructure setup](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/) guide.\n"
msgstr "Ang `qiskit_ibm_catalog` ay nagbibigay ng mga client-side na tool para mag-upload at magpatakbo ng mga remote na programa, habang ang `qiskit_serverless` ay nagbibigay ng mga server-side na tool para ipamahagi ang compute at pamahalaan ang data. Ang mga package na ito ay nangangailangan ng `python` 3.11+. Para sa mga gumagamit at organisasyon na gustong patakbuhin ang Qiskit Serverless sa custom na imprastraktura, sundin ang gabay na [Cloud infrastructure setup](https://qiskit.github.io/qiskit-serverless/).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
#| "Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects Qiskit Runtime workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Serverless workload's current status. Find an example in the [Run your first Qiskit Serverless workload remotely](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload#serverless-job-status) guide.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Currently, the IBM Quantum workloads table only reflects IBM Quantum Compute Service workloads. Use `job.status()` to see your Qiskit Serverless workload's current status. Find an example in the [Run your first Qiskit Serverless workload remotely](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload#serverless-job-status) guide.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Sa kasalukuyan, ang talahanayan ng IBM Quantum workloads ay nagpapakita lamang ng mga Qiskit Runtime workload. Gamitin ang `job.status()` para makita ang kasalukuyang status ng iyong Qiskit Serverless workload. Hanapin ang isang halimbawa sa gabay na [Patakbuhin ang iyong unang Qiskit Serverless workload nang remote](/guides/serverless-run-first-workload#serverless-job-status).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

